    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Bò lúc lắc is a quick stir-fry of beef cubes cooked using the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "luc-lac"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "lúc lắc "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "shaking technique in a very hot wok. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Use the best beef you can for this dish . sirloin or fillet gives the best results. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This recipe serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The dipping sauce "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "lime-pepper-dip"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "muối tiêu chanh "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "is essential. Mix lime juice with plenty of black pepper and a pinch of seasoning to serve alongside."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
